WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.410
Give thanks!

00:01:01.410 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.420
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.830
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:25.000
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:49.720
Someone once said:

00:01:50.090 --> 00:01:55.060
There was a king of a country 
in the present-day Gourmet Age,

00:01:55.060 --> 00:01:56.830
who led tens of thousands of soldiers

00:01:56.830 --> 00:02:00.830
to pacify the frontier 
of the Regal Highlands,

00:02:00.830 --> 00:02:03.970
and defeated a Regal Mammoth...

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:19.380
The king's only weakness was his stomach,

00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:25.090
but the instant he tasted the jewel 
meat he brought back with him...

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:28.130
...his body, transformed 
into that of a superhuman!

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:32.160
And thereafter prospered 
gloriously for a long time.

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:39.340
The citizens proclaimed him 
Jewelouis the 14th, the Sun King!

00:02:39.700 --> 00:02:42.770
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:43.070 --> 00:02:48.310
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:53.250
Toriko's group headed 
toward the Regal Mammoth

00:02:53.250 --> 00:02:55.990
to obtain the Jewel Meat inside of it.

00:02:57.690 --> 00:03:02.460
Coco and Sunny stopped the GT Robots 
through magnificent battles,

00:03:02.460 --> 00:03:05.760
leaving the capture of 
the Jewel Meat to Toriko.

00:03:06.730 --> 00:03:10.370
But Toriko encountered Starjun's GT Robot,

00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.070
and came perilously close 
to losing their lives...

00:03:14.370 --> 00:03:15.470
In order to survive,

00:03:15.470 --> 00:03:20.140
Toriko needed to eat something of 
incredible taste within 5 minutes.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:24.750
But while avenging Rin, he took 
another blow from Starjun,

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:26.520
falling once again onto death's doorstep...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:31.460
At the same time, Tina ran as fast 
as she could to call for help.

00:03:32.390 --> 00:03:36.190
Toriko discovered the Jewel Meat in 
the place he regained consciousness,

00:03:37.160 --> 00:03:42.230
and when he ate the Jewel Meat, he 
began to shine like a jewel himself!

00:03:45.970 --> 00:03:51.940
Super Toriko, the Fists of Anger! 
This is the Strongest Spiked Punch!

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.810
This is an excellent knife.

00:03:57.220 --> 00:04:00.020
I shall keep this knife.

00:04:02.490 --> 00:04:06.960
Anything but... that!

00:04:06.960 --> 00:04:09.530
Get in my way and you die.

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:12.330
I'm not afraid of death!

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:16.300
I came here prepared for 
the consequences, too!

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.640
Give it back!

00:04:29.310 --> 00:04:34.820
Oh? Looks like your conviction is sincere.

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:38.090
Yes. Unlike yours.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:49.330
In the end, you're the only one who 
wasn't prepared to die, GT Robot!

00:04:51.370 --> 00:04:52.600
Toriko!

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:54.610
Toriko-san!

00:04:58.210 --> 00:05:00.450
Release your pressure sense limits!

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:04.050
Have every blow transmitted 
fully to your real body.

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:05.520
Got it?

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:08.290
<i>That's</i> conviction!

00:05:16.130 --> 00:05:17.200
Toriko-san...

00:05:22.100 --> 00:05:24.470
Don't tell me... He's...

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:29.040
His cells are evolving.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:31.910
Did he eat the Jewel Meat?

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:33.680
Interesting...

00:05:36.580 --> 00:05:38.950
Release the pressure sense limits.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:41.320
But you are facing Toriko.

00:05:41.320 --> 00:05:44.390
If by some chance you take a direct hit,

00:05:44.590 --> 00:05:46.660
the damage you'll receive 
will be immeasurable...

00:05:46.660 --> 00:05:49.530
Release them! Now!

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:56.600
Let me hear your name.

00:05:57.170 --> 00:05:59.040
I am Starjun.

00:05:59.570 --> 00:06:00.970
Starjun...

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.640
My pressure sense limits have been released.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:09.680
Now all physical attacks 
will be transmitted at 100%.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:16.190
That's proof that your battle ability 
easily surpasses that of the GT Robot...

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:18.990
I prefer having no limits 
on the pressure sense.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:21.790
That way I can more accurately measure

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:24.060
how much more powerful you have now become.

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:25.530
Is that so?

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:29.900
Then I guess I better not disappoint you!

00:06:35.470 --> 00:06:37.510
Mixer Punch!

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:42.780
He stopped it?

00:06:44.550 --> 00:06:45.850
Knife!

00:06:47.750 --> 00:06:48.920
Knife!

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:49.820
Knife!

00:06:49.820 --> 00:06:50.190
Knife!

00:06:50.390 --> 00:06:51.390
Knife!

00:06:52.320 --> 00:06:54.760
Knife!!

00:07:01.300 --> 00:07:02.700
Fork!

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:05.100
Fork!

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:11.410
Peeler...

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.650
Five-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:25.290
I see... This is as far as it goes...

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.660
Was the Jewel Meat tasty, Toriko?

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.930
I will one day obtain the Jewel Meat...

00:07:34.530 --> 00:07:36.200
Until we meet again.

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:40.000
Next time, in the flesh.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:42.640
Yeah...

00:07:42.640 --> 00:07:48.210
Ten-Fold... Spiked Punch!

00:08:07.930 --> 00:08:09.970
Thank you for the meal.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.190
Toriko...

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:47.740
It's over.

00:08:48.940 --> 00:08:51.410
Toriko-san!

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:53.680
Toriko-san!

00:08:54.110 --> 00:08:55.810
Toriko-san, you're alive!

00:08:56.850 --> 00:08:59.350
Toriko-san, you're alive...

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.920
Rin, it's over.

00:09:04.790 --> 00:09:06.820
No, it isn't, Toriko.

00:09:08.090 --> 00:09:09.890
This is only the first course...

00:09:10.430 --> 00:09:12.400
...to the splendid banquet.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:14.730
Toriko-san?

00:09:17.570 --> 00:09:21.740
Rin, this blood smells like active iron!

00:09:22.140 --> 00:09:23.740
We've got to hurry outside!

00:09:24.510 --> 00:09:26.140
Rin's alive!

00:09:30.650 --> 00:09:33.350
You silly Mammoth, that's 
some good timing you've got!

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:34.320
Let's hurry!

00:09:34.320 --> 00:09:35.020
Right!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.490
Toriko, we have to bring it back with us.

00:09:37.490 --> 00:09:40.090
Yup! Can't forget that!

00:09:50.070 --> 00:09:52.270
The poison has finally run out, I see?

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:53.940
We should probably get some distance.

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:56.440
What about Toriko and the others, Coco?

00:09:56.440 --> 00:09:58.210
What about Rin and Matsu?

00:09:58.210 --> 00:10:00.350
Isn't it more beautiful 
to have faith in them?

00:10:00.610 --> 00:10:04.720
You are really a profoundly 
beautiful man, Sunny.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:07.350
There is no need to worry. Everyone is safe.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.020
They're coming out now.

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.290
Toriko!

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.390
Sunny, cushion, please!

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:17.660
And that's the Jewel Meat!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:21.170
I'll catch with ultimate delicacy!

00:10:21.170 --> 00:10:22.600
Hair Net!

00:10:26.740 --> 00:10:29.140
Incredible... So that's the Jewel Meat?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:32.940
So it's the meat you were catching?

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.780
Well, duh.

00:10:34.780 --> 00:10:37.020
Sunny-san, Rin-san is...

00:10:38.050 --> 00:10:38.880
Rin!

00:10:39.320 --> 00:10:40.850
Took you long enough to notice!

00:10:40.850 --> 00:10:41.920
Treat her, okay?

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.190
Hair Operation!

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.130
Komatsu-kun!

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:54.370
Coco-san!

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:55.900
What is Sunny-san doing?

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:59.370
He's performing an operation 
with 0.1 micron feelers.

00:10:59.570 --> 00:11:01.210
An operation? Wow!

00:11:01.210 --> 00:11:04.940
Just emergency first-aid until we can 
get her treated properly, though.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:09.000
Kiss is headed to the laboratory 
to call for a medical team.

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.850
They should be arriving shortly.

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:13.350
Rin-san will be okay?

00:11:13.350 --> 00:11:16.620
No need to worry. Rin-chan 
isn't going to die.

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.790
I cannot see the shadow of death on Rin-chan.

00:11:21.130 --> 00:11:24.330
I wonder whose it was I 
saw back at the start?

00:11:25.630 --> 00:11:28.500
I'm convinced now. It was Toriko's!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:32.470
I can clearly see far stronger 
electromagnetic waves coming from his body now.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:35.110
It was only for a brief time,

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:38.080
but the EM waves I saw stop from within 
the mammoth's body were Toriko's...

00:11:39.140 --> 00:11:40.780
He passed through the valley of death,

00:11:40.780 --> 00:11:42.710
evolved, and came back to us!

00:11:47.550 --> 00:11:48.950
Terry!

00:11:50.050 --> 00:11:51.620
You were safe!

00:11:51.620 --> 00:11:54.860
You made the Obasaurus your servant?

00:11:56.260 --> 00:11:59.360
And after he gave me so much 
trouble... You son-of-a-gun!

00:11:59.360 --> 00:12:01.430
Anyway, good job, Terry!

00:12:05.970 --> 00:12:08.010
The medical team is here!

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:11.510
And the young Regal Mammoth, too!

00:12:11.510 --> 00:12:14.210
Kiss must be leading them here!

00:12:14.210 --> 00:12:16.510
Aren't you glad, Regal parent?

00:12:19.480 --> 00:12:24.620
Thank you. I'm in your debt, Regal 
Mammoth... Ancient treasured food...

00:12:27.030 --> 00:12:28.630
It's stomping us!

00:12:28.630 --> 00:12:31.230
It's still a big-bang bowl of mad!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:32.760
Sunny, use a Spatula!

00:12:32.760 --> 00:12:34.330
Wouldn't poison be better here, Coco?

00:12:34.330 --> 00:12:36.000
Anyway, we're heading back to the laboratory!

00:12:36.000 --> 00:12:36.770
Right!

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:39.500
It's tasting time for the Jewel Meat!

00:12:55.920 --> 00:12:56.690
Rin!

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:57.760
Rin-san!

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:58.260
Rin!

00:12:59.390 --> 00:13:00.490
Everyone...

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:03.800
I can't believe it...

00:13:04.230 --> 00:13:07.630
The Gourmet Cells are alive 
and dividing so quickly...

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:09.730
Regenerating her tissue...

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.170
Rin-san is well-suited for Gourmet Cells.

00:13:13.170 --> 00:13:16.040
She must have tasted some 
delicious ingredient.

00:13:16.040 --> 00:13:19.780
I wonder what in the world 
that ingredient was?

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:33.390
Thank you... Toriko...

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:37.700
Toriko!

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:39.160
Toriko...

00:13:39.160 --> 00:13:40.160
What?

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:42.470
Man, I'm like so thankful, seriously!

00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:43.230
Huh?

00:13:43.230 --> 00:13:47.570
It's because you gave that to 
me that I'm alive like this...

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:49.240
What do you mean, that?

00:13:49.240 --> 00:13:51.310
Going to pretend nothing happened, are you?

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:52.710
Did I do something?

00:13:52.710 --> 00:13:55.880
You and I might be something more, now...

00:13:55.880 --> 00:13:57.220
Uh...

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:00.520
Right! Anyway, Rin's all better.

00:14:00.520 --> 00:14:03.450
Yeah! Time to start one splendid dinner!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:05.290
Yippee!

00:14:17.160 --> 00:14:19.770
How goes it, Chief Mansom?

00:14:19.770 --> 00:14:21.040
Handsome?

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:22.810
Oh, Shige-san.

00:14:23.240 --> 00:14:25.240
And you have Zebra with you as well?

00:14:25.240 --> 00:14:29.610
With him, it would have been 
easier to capture the mammoth...

00:14:29.610 --> 00:14:31.550
There is also the matter 
of Chief Glass's pride.

00:14:31.550 --> 00:14:33.350
He was dead set against Zebra being set free.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:38.490
We cannot let that problem child out 
in the field so simply now, can we?

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:41.060
Then for what reason have you, Shige-san,

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:45.330
the Vice President of the 
IGO, come here yourself?

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.630
For another reason...

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:55.670
Thank you for your patience.

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:11.060
This is a heaping helping of Jewel Meat.

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:12.660
What I've been waiting for!

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:15.530
T-That's... Jewel Meat!

00:15:16.830 --> 00:15:18.300
It's too beautiful!

00:15:18.500 --> 00:15:21.370
I can see the shining of moonlight!

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:23.700
It's like high noon around us!

00:15:23.700 --> 00:15:29.410
I suppose to light up the inside of 
that huge mammoth, it's only natural.

00:15:29.410 --> 00:15:30.880
Anyway, let's eat!

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:31.780
Yeah!

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:35.180
We give thanks to all this 
world's great bounty!

00:15:35.180 --> 00:15:36.650
Let's eat!

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.420
So bright...

00:15:40.420 --> 00:15:42.720
And yet, it's a gentle light.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.590
It's meat juice fireworks!

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.670
Not only is it gorgeous to look at,

00:15:58.670 --> 00:16:02.510
but the unadorned deliciousness of 
the meat explodes inside my mouth...

00:16:03.240 --> 00:16:05.980
It's crunchy to my teeth like heart,

00:16:05.980 --> 00:16:08.980
but as I chew, the meat 
juice keeps coming out...

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.850
so it's not a chore in the slightest!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.530
Incredible!

00:16:27.530 --> 00:16:31.740
It's like each cell in my body 
is sparkling with delight!

00:16:32.500 --> 00:16:34.710
Amazing, don't you think, Toriko-san?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:37.880
He's shining super-bright!

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:40.910
This section is liver!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.050
But there's no smell or bitterness...

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:45.750
It's a sturdy, creamy flavor!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.850
This part is rib meat!

00:16:49.850 --> 00:16:52.760
There are so many layers of meat and fat...

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:56.560
This melting in my mouth 
feeling may be the best ever!

00:16:57.830 --> 00:17:00.030
Oh, sirloin!

00:17:00.030 --> 00:17:02.170
It dissolves in my mouth instantly...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:06.000
It's fairly fatty, but smooth 
and goes down easily.

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:09.370
Taste, texture... And from 
so many different cuts!

00:17:09.370 --> 00:17:11.740
It's almost like a carnival!

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:16.010
Dear viewers, this is the ancient 
food treasure, the Jewel Meat!

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:18.750
Toriko-san, how does it taste?

00:17:18.750 --> 00:17:20.790
Stop that already and try it yourself.

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:22.290
Uh, but I...

00:17:22.290 --> 00:17:24.890
Fine, then take some back with you.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.530
Show everyone what it's like when you eat it.

00:17:27.530 --> 00:17:28.790
It's real good.

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:30.800
Are you sure?

00:17:30.800 --> 00:17:32.460
Yeah, do it.

00:17:32.900 --> 00:17:34.870
I've got to thank you, too.

00:17:34.870 --> 00:17:36.070
Thank me?

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:41.140
The reason we can all eat this Jewel Meat

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:44.810
is because you woke me up back then.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.180
Toriko!

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.080
What're you talking about so friendly like?

00:17:50.750 --> 00:17:53.890
Well, I guess you helped out a bunch.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.150
I'll let it slide this time.

00:17:56.150 --> 00:17:57.890
Terry, you eat some too!

00:17:57.890 --> 00:17:58.960
It's good!

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:01.290
You eat too, Kiss.

00:18:02.560 --> 00:18:03.860
Where did Komatsu-kun go?

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:06.800
Komatsu!

00:18:06.800 --> 00:18:10.700
We finally got the meat, so I 
thought I'd put it to use again.

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.340
The Gourmet Spicer?

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:12.970
Yup!

00:18:13.440 --> 00:18:14.670
I've been wanting to have you eat

00:18:14.670 --> 00:18:19.210
the most incredibly delicious 
food possible, Toriko-san!

00:18:19.680 --> 00:18:24.520
A sweet smell of citrus fruit, perfectly 
matched with a hint of cinnamon!

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.980
I can't get enough!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.490
I've never smelled a spice like this before!

00:18:28.490 --> 00:18:33.460
It's a powder I created with 3 parts 
Orangesalt and 2 parts Cinnamontail.

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.360
Go ahead.

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:36.560
Let's eat!

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.830
Yum!

00:18:40.830 --> 00:18:42.630
He's shining even brighter than before!

00:18:42.830 --> 00:18:46.270
What harmony between the 
bright salt bringing out

00:18:46.270 --> 00:18:48.670
the meat flavor and the sweet aroma!

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:53.950
It's just like a samba rhythm making 
the carnival all the more exciting!

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:55.910
I'll eat some, too!

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.650
Hey, don't push yourself, Rin.

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:03.220
They're all ingredients that were 
captured within the Regal Mammoth.

00:19:03.220 --> 00:19:04.190
I see...

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:07.930
The ultimate spices to 
match with the Jewel Meat.

00:19:07.930 --> 00:19:08.790
Yes!

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:21.410
I suppose this decides it.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:24.810
What? What did you just say, Toriko?

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:27.680
You're shining so much, Sunny!

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.850
Sunny is shining the brightest of all!

00:19:30.850 --> 00:19:33.580
His EM waves are strengthening 
along with the brightness.

00:19:34.290 --> 00:19:39.190
I bet that Sunny's Gourmet Cells are 
extremely compatible with the Jewel Meat...

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:42.690
So Toriko, what did you just say?

00:19:42.690 --> 00:19:44.930
What do you mean?

00:19:45.230 --> 00:19:49.200
Did you just say you decided something?

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:49.830
Yeah!

00:19:50.770 --> 00:19:55.170
I was thinking a meat like this 
would be good to have on it...

00:19:58.380 --> 00:20:01.580
Good to have on what?

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:06.720
For the Meat Dish of my Full Course!

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:08.050
Toriko-san!

00:20:08.050 --> 00:20:09.190
I agree!

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:11.690
Hold it!

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:16.330
What do you think you're doing, Sunny?!

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.900
What am <i>I</i> doing?!

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:18.700
Don't go being so hasty!

00:20:18.700 --> 00:20:19.960
I ain't being hasty!

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:22.330
And besides, look at this shining!

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:23.840
Yeah, pretty awesome.

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:26.100
Your point?

00:20:27.040 --> 00:20:31.640
Don't you think the Jewel Meat has chosen me?

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.280
Don't tell me... Brother...

00:20:34.910 --> 00:20:39.480
I've decided the Jewel 
Meat will be my Main Dish!

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.490
Hold it!

00:20:41.690 --> 00:20:43.090
What do you think you're doing, Toriko?

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:44.890
Why is it <i>your</i> Main, huh?

00:20:44.890 --> 00:20:47.160
'Cause I'm the one that's 
sparkling more, duh!

00:20:47.160 --> 00:20:48.730
What's that got to do with it?

00:20:48.730 --> 00:20:51.960
{[\a6}Isn't it all because of 
me we got the meat anyway?

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:54.200
As if! Keep blabbing nonsense 
and I'll feed you a 10-fold!

00:20:52.300 --> 00:20:56.630
Couldn't you just both have the Jewel 
Meat on your Full Course menus?

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.930
Bring it! And I'll flip it right back!

00:20:55.930 --> 00:20:57.070
Oh, yeah?!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:57.670
No way!

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:58.740
Why?

00:20:58.740 --> 00:21:01.340
I don't want my dish to be copied!

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:04.110
I think it should be Toriko's Meat Dish.

00:21:04.110 --> 00:21:05.010
Shut up, Rin!

00:21:05.010 --> 00:21:06.680
You're the one who should shut it!

00:21:07.150 --> 00:21:10.050
I haven't got 1 gram of 
the Jewel Meat on film!

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:12.420
It's too bright!

00:21:12.420 --> 00:21:14.020
Should we continue eating?

00:21:14.020 --> 00:21:15.520
Yeah...

00:21:31.470 --> 00:21:37.110
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:43.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:50.660
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:55.560
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:21:56.830 --> 00:22:00.700
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:00.700 --> 00:22:04.070
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:04.070 --> 00:22:08.540
on a journey with no end!

00:22:10.340 --> 00:22:13.480
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:16.650
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:22.620
amid the waves of time.

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:27.160
Gourmet News!

00:22:28.560 --> 00:22:30.030
Good morning!

00:22:30.030 --> 00:22:31.560
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:37.070
As Toriko requested, I am now going 
to taste the Jewel Meat for everyone!

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:44.640
This is the taste of shoulder meat!

00:22:44.710 --> 00:22:46.880
Like a pure extract of delicious red meat!

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:54.850
Incredibly juicy, and...

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:58.890
I guess the Jewel Meat's deliciousness

00:22:58.890 --> 00:23:01.560
and destructive power are both not normal.

00:23:02.260 --> 00:23:04.260
Now then, on to the next story.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.430
Toriko heads to Terry's homeland

00:23:08.430 --> 00:23:10.740
and takes on the ingredients of the Gourmet World!

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:13.100
I smell a fresh scoop!

00:23:13.330 --> 00:23:17.340
The Taste Written in its DNA! 
Toriko, Search for the BB Corn!

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:19.510
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
